    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d36-a6">

                <pb facs="0139" n="43" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg43"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure to inclosure
                    5.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Colonel Basler to Mr. Chester.</hi>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">To the Consulate of the United States of America at
                        Budapest:</hi>
                </p>
                <p>Referring to your letter of inquiry No. 831, under date of the 5th instant, you
                    are informed with official respect that Ignatz Gutman is in actual service since
                    the 7th of January of this year in the Second Company (of the Twenty-fifth
                    Regiment) at Losoncz station as volunteer for three years’ service.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Basler</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Colonel of the I. and II. Regiment of Infantry, Freiherr von Purcker,
                            No. 25</hi>.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-03-08"><hi rendition="#italic">March 8,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
